# 2v2 gasless 15/15/15 roach build, no capped larva after the opener (found with
# scripts/bo_search.py stage I, 2026-10-14, patch 5.0.17, Reclamation LE spawn 0).
# Rule: after 1:10 no hatchery ever sits at 3 larva; roaches by 4:20; most drones at 4:00.
# Timeline (supply/cap):
#   1:52 queens 1+2 together (26/28) - 1:59 overlord (26/28) - 2:09 overlord (27/28)
#   2:28/2:30 queens 3+4 (32-34/44) - 2:37 overlord (35/44)
#   2:52 both gases (main + natural), next 6 drones to gas (your median gas time, too)
#   3:07 roach warren (asked for at 3:02; the bank allows it at 3:07), done 3:47
#   3:48 roach 1 as the warren finishes; 3:58-3:59 roaches 2-6 off the 3:57 inject
#   roaches pop 4:07 and 4:17-4:18; 3rd hatch 4:08; 46 drones at 4:00
# Versus 2v2_roach_4q.bo (roaches out by ~4:00): +6 drones at 4:00 and no capped larva,
# for roaches ~18 s later.
14 extractor_trick
15 hatch natural
-  default main
14 extractor_trick
15 overlord
15 pool
@natural_soon transfer 4 main natural
-  default fill
& @2:52 extractor main
& @2:52 extractor natural
& @2:52 rally gas:main x3
& @2:52 rally gas:natural x3
& @3:02 roach_warren
& @warren roaches 6 asap
& @roaches hatch third
@pool queens main natural
26 overlord main
27 overlord main
@queen:main queen main
@queen:natural queen natural
-  auto_overlords
